criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. Patients who have had at least one consultation or examination at the Sleep and Vigilance Center at Hôtel-Dieu since January 1, 2005;
2. Patients diagnosed with narcolepsy (type 1 or type 2) or idiopathic hypersomnia;
3. Adult patients (aged 18 or over);
4. Patients who have not objected to the processing of their data.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Minors;
2. Patients who object to the processing of their data;
3. Patients under guardianship or conservatorship.
